  "body": "My first take on https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/90\r\n\r\nThe PR\r\n - Fixes a typo\r\n - Fixes some HTML table semantic inconsistencies appearing in the spec\r\n - Customizes all calls to Printer and Logger by not reusing the same `logLevels`\r\n - Adds a section/table discussing/grouping console methods by log level severity\r\n - Adds a section discussing some possible and common UX innovations Printer may perform\r\n - should close https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/90\r\n - that might be it?\r\n\r\n@domenic Note the TODO section appearing in the \"Indicating logLevel Severity\" section. If you want to push up a picture of an example that the TODO is talking about (edge), that might be helpful to include.",
